id: hac-g36l
title: Implement bounded entity delta and automation platform subscriptions
description: "Extend the typed WebSocket client and command surface for subscribe_entities, trigger_platforms/subscribe, and condition_platforms/subscribe with bounded collection, filtering, normalization, help, schemas, docs, and exact coverage."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 0
tags[5]: agents,automation,entity-delta,typescript,websocket
