close_reason: "Implementation and local acceptance complete: bounded entity deltas, automation platform catalogs, full docs, exact coverage, strict quality, security, compiled help, and privacy-safe live E2E all pass."
body: Implement a reusable typed subscription collector without dynamic imports or any; normalize entity delta protocol payloads without losing remove/add/change semantics; filter after protocol decoding; return deterministic envelopes; add platform subscription commands; retain raw call passthrough.
